      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Coordination between replicas: PostgreSQL row locks (outbox claims) · Kafka consumer groups (partitions) ·\nRedis leases + fenced end-of-attempt updates (one attempt at a time). Execution is always asynchronous:\nthe API never waits for a job to run.",
      "originalText": "Coordination between replicas: PostgreSQL row locks (outbox claims) · Kafka consumer groups (partitions) ·\nRedis leases + fenced end-of-attempt updates (one attempt at a time). Execution is always asynchronous:\nthe API never waits for a job to run.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
